# Local Worker secrets for `npm run dev` (`wrangler dev`). This starter has none:
# @dwk/webfinger and @dwk/host-meta are stateless and configured in src/index.ts.
#
# Every line below is deliberately commented out. The Deploy to Cloudflare button
# reads this file (as it does `.env.example`) and prompts for each uncommented
# KEY= as a Worker secret. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and uncomment there.
#
# Having a `.dev.vars` also stops `wrangler dev` from loading `.env` into the
# Worker's `env`, so CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN in `.env` stays out of it.
#
# --- Composing more @dwk packages in ---
# List the secrets their Env fragments declare (spec/packages/<name>.md) here,
# uncommented, so the Deploy button asks for them; put local values in `.dev.vars`:
# TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY=           # e.g. @dwk/indieauth; `openssl rand -base64 32`
